	</item>
	<item>
		<title><![CDATA[Kontakt]]></title>
		<link>https://gazdlaprzemyslu.pl/kontakt/</link>
		<pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[redaktor]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://gazdlaprzemyslu.pl/?p=1021</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:group {"metadata":{"name":"Nagłówek strony"},"templateLock":"contentOnly","align":"full","className":"gdp-hero gdp-hero-produkt","style":{"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"var:preset|spacing|60","bottom":"var:preset|spacing|60"}}},"backgroundColor":"surface","layout":{"type":"constrained"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group alignfull gdp-hero gdp-hero-produkt has-surface-background-color has-background" style="padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60)"><!-- wp:heading {"level":1} -->
<h1 class="wp-block-heading">Kontakt</h1>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"fontSize":"m"} -->
<p class="has-m-font-size">Najszybsza droga do oferty to wgranie faktury. Jeśli wolisz rozmowę albo masz pytanie o umowę, napisz lub zadzwoń. Odpowiadamy w dni robocze w godzinach [[godziny]].</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:buttons -->
<div class="wp-block-buttons"><!-- wp:button -->
<div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="/wgraj-fakture/">Wgraj fakturę</a></div>
<!-- /wp:button --></div>
<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:group {"metadata":{"name":"Dane i formularz"},"templateLock":"contentOnly","align":"full","style":{"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"var:preset|spacing|70","bottom":"var:preset|spacing|70"}}},"layout":{"type":"constrained"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group alignfull" style="padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70)"><!-- wp:columns {"align":"wide"} -->
<div class="wp-block-columns alignwide"><!-- wp:column -->
<div class="wp-block-column"><!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Dane kontaktowe</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:group {"metadata":{"name":"Dane podmiotu"},"className":"gdp-karta","layout":{"type":"constrained"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group gdp-karta"><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"gdp-dane-podmiotu"} -->
<p class="gdp-dane-podmiotu"><strong>PBM Sp. z o.o.</strong></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>[[ulica i numer]]<br>[[kod pocztowy, miejscowość]]</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Telefon: [[numer]]<br>E-mail: [[adres]]</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Godziny: [[dni i godziny]]</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"gdp-tekst-pomocniczy"} -->
<p class="gdp-tekst-pomocniczy">KRS [[ ]] · NIP [[ ]] · REGON [[ ]]</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"fontSize":"s"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-s-font-size">Dla doradców</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Osobna ścieżka i formularz na stronie <a href="/dla-doradcow/">dla doradców</a>.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"fontSize":"s"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-s-font-size">Dane osobowe</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Kontakt w sprawach danych: [[adres IOD]]. <a href="/polityka-prywatnosci/">Polityka prywatności</a>.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:column -->

<!-- wp:column -->
<div class="wp-block-column"><!-- wp:group {"metadata":{"name":"Formularz kontaktowy (slot)"},"className":"gdp-karta","layout":{"type":"constrained"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group gdp-karta"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"fontSize":"m"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-m-font-size">Napisz do nas</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Odpowiemy w [[czas]] roboczych.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"gdp-etykieta-pola"} -->
<p class="gdp-etykieta-pola">Imię i nazwisko</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"gdp-pole"} -->
<p class="gdp-pole">Jan Kowalski</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"gdp-etykieta-pola"} -->
<p class="gdp-etykieta-pola">Firma i NIP</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"gdp-pole"} -->
<p class="gdp-pole">Nazwa firmy, 10 cyfr</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"gdp-etykieta-pola"} -->
<p class="gdp-etykieta-pola">E-mail i telefon</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"gdp-pole"} -->
<p class="gdp-pole">imie.nazwisko@firma.pl, +48</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"gdp-etykieta-pola"} -->
<p class="gdp-etykieta-pola">Temat</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"gdp-pole"} -->
<p class="gdp-pole">Oferta / umowa / faktura / inne</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"gdp-etykieta-pola"} -->
<p class="gdp-etykieta-pola">Wiadomość</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"gdp-pole"} -->
<p class="gdp-pole">Opisz krótko, czego dotyczy pytanie</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:buttons -->
<div class="wp-block-buttons"><!-- wp:button -->
<div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="/kontakt/">Wyślij</a></div>
<!-- /wp:button --></div>
<!-- /wp:buttons -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"gdp-tekst-pomocniczy"} -->
<p class="gdp-tekst-pomocniczy">Zgoda: [[treść zgody dostarczy zleceniodawca]] · <a href="/polityka-prywatnosci/">Polityka prywatności</a></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></div>
<!-- /wp:column --></div>
<!-- /wp:columns --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:group {"metadata":{"name":"Mapa (placeholder)"},"templateLock":"contentOnly","align":"full","style":{"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"var:preset|spacing|70","bottom":"var:preset|spacing|70"}}},"backgroundColor":"surface","layout":{"type":"constrained"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group alignfull has-surface-background-color has-background" style="padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70)"><!-- wp:heading {"fontSize":"m"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-m-font-size">Jak do nas trafić</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:group {"metadata":{"name":"Mapa (placeholder)"},"className":"gdp-karta","layout":{"type":"constrained"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group gdp-karta"><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><span class="gdp-placeholder">[[mapa: bez osadzeń zewnętrznych w etapie 1; docelowo statyczny obraz albo osadzenie zgodne z polityką prywatności]]</span></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>[[wskazówki dojazdu, parking, wejście]]</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->]]></content:encoded>
		<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[]]></excerpt:encoded>
